":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/update(entryID:tempo:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":", this is expected to reorder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entries — that is the point of editing the beat time itself. Two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entries legitimately ending up at the same beat time (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for the discontinuity use case) is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not treated as a collision to reject; the moved entry simply takes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its place among any others already there, exactly as a fresh"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"insertion would."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The one case where ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" stops identifying the moved entry afterward is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the move lands it exactly on top of another entry already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present — same beat time, tempo, and extras — the same exact-duplicate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"case ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" silently collapses. There, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moved entry merges into that pre-existing one instead of being kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"separately, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"entryID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" no longer names anything in the map; the returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity is the survivor’s instead